<title>UK: Dept de la Meuse to set 150 mln FRF domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Dept de la Meuse to set 150 mln FRF domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Departement de la Meuse is planning a 150 million French franc 12-year domestic bond, Caisse des Depots et Consignations said on Thursday as lead manager. The launch was due Friday, depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>The deal will be guaranteed by U.S. insurer MBIA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
